WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:02.100
[Original ambient score]
A thin pendant emerges from the dark.

00:02.100 --> 00:05.200
Be here.

00:06.100 --> 00:07.500
Introducing AURA.

00:07.500 --> 00:10.600
Keep the thought.
Wearable note-taking. Development concept.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.000
One press. Stay present.

00:13.000 --> 00:15.800
Intended interaction:
visible recording and tactile feedback.

00:16.200 --> 00:17.900
Yours to control.

00:17.900 --> 00:21.000
Physical mic disconnect.
You decide when to capture.

00:21.450 --> 00:23.600
From thought to next step.

00:23.600 --> 00:26.800
Illustrative phone-assisted notes.
Capture offline. Organize with your phone.

00:28.550 --> 00:31.350
AURA. Be here. Keep the thought.
A wearable note-taking concept.

00:31.350 --> 00:36.000
Development concept.
Features subject to engineering validation.
